Package: uke-ssc-fileservice
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, udev, util-linux, grep, init-system-helpers, uke-sensorproxy-dual-light-abi-1, uke-ssc-firmware-inputs-abi-1
Description: native Uke SSC service with a disposable registry
 Serve shared upstream FastRPC from a private RAM tree, preserving read-only
 factory calibration and file permissions. Qualified local firmware and the
 Uke dual-light SensorProxy are required separately. No private data is shipped.
